      "writtenOn": "2024-12-20T08:21:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Changed these to a pending list and a serving map of iface-\u003etethering request, which are updated within the Tethering call. This way Tethering is always in sync with itself instead of querying into IpServer, which may be out of sync with any changes posted to its handler.",
