      "message": "IIRC, this is not as simple as adding TETHERING_ETHERNET to ifaceNameToType, because *I believe* that will cause link or interface events to bring up an IpServer on that interface. You might be able to fix this by only starting an IpServer if a) an TetheringRequest exists, or b) a synthesized TetheringRequest exists.",
